# Private name ==> public replacement, one per line, longest names applied first.
# A word-like name matches whole words, case-insensitively; a name with `/` or
# `@` matches literally. A replacement uses only letters, digits, `.`, `_`, `/`,
# `@` and `-`, so HTML escaping in generated pages cannot change it.
acme-billing==>billing-app
acme-billing-api==>billing-api
client-org==>client-org-a
/Users/me==>/Users/alice
